  "thag1.94:1.1": "Namo hi tassa bhagavato ",
  "thag1.94:1.2": "Sakyaputtassa sirīmato, ",
  "thag1.94:1.3": "tenāyaṃ aggapattena ",
  "thag1.94:1.4": "aggadhammo sudesito 'ti. Andho 'haṃ ",
  "thag1.94:1.5": "hatanetto 'smi, kantāraddhāna pakkhanno, sayamāno pi "
}
